msgstr "Pangkalahatang-tanaw {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-machine-learning/hero.svg)\n"
msgstr "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-machine-learning/hero.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This course explores how quantum computing can play an exciting role in machine learning. The course will offer some review of classical machine learning approaches, but will also assume some familiarity with these methods. The primary focus will be how quantum computing can fit into existing machine learning workflows. Topics include data encoding, quantum kernels, and variational quantum circuits.\n"
msgstr "Tinutuklas ng kursong ito kung paano maaaring gumanap ng kapana-panabik na papel ang quantum computing sa machine learning. Mag-aalok ang kurso ng ilang pagbabalik-aral sa mga klasikal na diskarte sa machine learning, ngunit inaasahan ding may kaunting kaalaman ka na sa mga pamamaraang ito. Ang pangunahing pokus ay kung paano maaaring isama ang quantum computing sa mga kasalukuyang workflow ng machine learning. Kasama sa mga paksa ang pag-encode ng data, quantum kernels, at variational quantum circuits.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam {#exam}"
msgstr "Pagsusulit {#exam}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To earn your badge for Quantum machine learning, take the exam at IBM&reg; Training. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the lessons in this course. After you pass the exam, you will be notified by Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr "Para makuha ang iyong badge para sa Quantum machine learning, kumuha ng pagsusulit sa IBM&reg; Training. Ang pagsusulit na ito ay inilaan para gawin pagkatapos basahin ang mga aralin sa kursong ito. Pagkatapos mong pumasa sa pagsusulit, aabisuhan ka ng Credly na nakakuha ka ng badge.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
